Agenda item: 6.1.3.2 Document for: Discussion and Decision In the last meeting, there was a hot discussion on the intraBandENDC-Support, and meanwhile a LS was also received from RAN4, in which a candidate solution was provided for the UL-DL inconsistent cases as below: Case 3: All CCs are contiguous in DL but neither carrier is contiguous to each other in UL, including Case 4: One of LTE carriers and the NR carrier are contiguous in DL, contiguous and non-contiguous are both supported in UL: Furthermore, in RAN2, a potential solution was also provided in [2][3]. In this paper, we share our further vies on these on Table solutions. In this chapter, we first analyse the solutions in [1][2][3], and then share our views on this topic.

