This is the fourth meeting on which RAN2 discusses the “AI/ML for NR Air Interface” SI (see the approved SID in RP-213599, and the revised version in RP-221348). This is the first meeting though on which we have a sub–Agenda Item intended to discuss alternatives model control procedures. So, in this contribution we discuss about model/functionality applicability. This is a topic that appeared to have quite some interest during RAN1’s February meeting, and as observed in the description below, there is clearly RAN2 implications to it. Therefore, we believe that it should also be addressed by our WG. However, at this point (and given the challenges imposed by the e-meeting format) we believe that Agenda Items 7.16.2.1 and 7.16.2.2 should perhaps be prioritized. Our intention here is mostly to introduce the topic in RAN2, discussing the scope and providing some high-level ideas on how to address the matter.

